                "text": "Let's solve the equation:\n\n\\[\n\\sin(x) + x^2 = 42\n\\]\n\nThis is a transcendental equation that does not have an explicit algebraic solution. We can solve it numerically for real values of \\( x \\).\n\nI'll use a numerical method to find the solution. Let's proceed!",
